，胃口全無。\n• 聊天沒口罩： 廚師煎餃子時沒戴口罩且一直聊天，口水直接噴進煎鍋裡，基本衛生意識蕩然無存。\n\n❌ 環境與效率：設計不良，出餐混亂\n• 座位侷促： 屋台位置極小，後面的掛簾一直卡脖子。\n• 出餐極慢： 兩個人沒分工，煎餃等了 20 分鐘。連旁邊桌的客人都吃完麵了，飲料才送上。\n\n總結：\n這家店 CP 值為 0，純粹靠火影 IP 坑錢。看到旁邊客人也都在搖頭發負評（真的有人跟我一樣在忍受這一切），就知道不是我的要求高，而是這家店真的太差。已從 Google Map 儲存清單移除，永不回訪！",null,[0,93]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8365076187111850696/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUWs1RVVrdGlNa1pOWTIxMFZWbFlUbHBYYkZKWlVtdGFWbVJyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8365076187111850696/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUWs1RVVrdGlNa1pOWTIxMFZWbFlUbHBYYkZKWlVtdGFWbVJyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8365076187111850696/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUWs1RVVrdGlNa1pOWTIxMFZWbFlUbHBYYkZKWlVtdGFWbVJyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8365076187111850696/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUWs1RVVrdGlNa1pOWTIxMFZWbFlUbHBYYkZKWlVtdGFWbVJyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8365076187111850696/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUWs1RVVrdGlNa1pOWTIxMFZWbFlUbHBYYkZKWlVtdGFWbVJyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8365076187111850696/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPUWs1RVVrdGlNa1pOWTIxMFZWbFlUbHBYYkZKWlVtdGFWbVJyUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,4934,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOQk5EUktiMkZNY210VVlYTlpXbFJZUmtaVmRrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb6fb21fe49ca6373!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkNBNDRKb2FMcmtUYXNZWlRYRkZVdkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOQk5EUktiMkZNY210VVlYTlpXbFJZUmtaVmRrRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOQk5EUktiMkZNY210VVlYTlpXbFJZUmtaVmRrRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOQk5EUktiMkZNY210VVlYTlpXbFJZ